<title>LEBANON: Bank of Beirut shares open at $3.</title>
<headline>Bank of Beirut shares open at $3.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Beirut shares traded for the first time on the Beirut Stock Exchange at $3 on Friday, 38 percent above the bank's share issue price.</p>
<p>Turnover was 320,727 shares.</p>
<p>The shares were valued at $2.17 each last week in a $10.4 million private placement which was 11 times oversubscribed.</p>
